<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Leather Skin</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 8)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast leather skin</a>   (on yourself only)
</pre>
<p>Toughens your skin like soft leather armour. Wherever a blow lands on a part 
of you that wears no armour, your skin counts as leather. Where you do wear 
armour, the armour counts as before.
</p><p>It lasts a few minutes, longer the better your spell, and then wears off. It 
doesn't add up with bark skin or stone skin: only one natural armour spell 
works at a time. You must be standing. It is also found on potions and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bark Skin</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Stone Skin</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Armour</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>